### THE PROJECT SPECIFIES #################################################

### Node ###
# Ignorefiles
.*ignore

# Husky (generated shim scripts; nested .gitignore is not read by Prettier)
.husky/_/

# Pnpm
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Vendored Claude Code skill bundles (re-synced verbatim from upstream;
# reformatting on every re-sync makes the diff noisy for no benefit)
.claude/skills/

# Vendored IDD workflow surfaces (re-synced verbatim from
# kurone-kito/idd-skill; prettier-plugin-sh corrupts fenced ```sh
# argument placeholders in these files, so they are excluded from
# Prettier entirely rather than re-corrupted on every format run).
# docs/idd-policy.md is locally authored and stays Prettier-formatted,
# so it is re-included after the broader docs/idd-*.md ignore below.
.github/instructions/
docs/idd-*.md
!docs/idd-policy.md
docs/concepts.md
docs/customization.md
docs/getting-started.md
docs/index.md
docs/permissions.md
docs/policy-constants.md
docs/reference.md
docs/onboarding/
profiles/
.githooks/

# Vendored IDD helper bundle (scripts/, schemas/, fixtures/schemas/,
# re-synced verbatim from kurone-kito/idd-skill; carries generated-from
# banners that must stay byte-identical to upstream across every
# re-import). prettier-plugin-sh and prettier-plugin-sort-json would
# reformat these on every run, so they are excluded entirely. Anchored
# to the repository root so nested package dirs of the same name (e.g.
# packages/web/scripts/) are not accidentally swept in.
/scripts/
/schemas/
/fixtures/schemas/
